[0.060, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BWhic\u001b[8G do\u001b[12Gy\u001b[15G want: round 5, J30, or something else?\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gdidn't check\u001b[18Gwhether Codex's usage lim\u001b[44Gt h\u001b[48Gs \u001b[51Geset, or wh\u001b[64Gher Manifest's L15 is near the front of its delivery\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Border.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GBaked for 15s · done 5:04 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mstart round 5\u001b[39m                                                                                                         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m3\u001b[22m directories, ran \u001b[1m9\u001b[22m shell commands, recalled \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m memories · \u001b[38;2;255;107;128m1 failed\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRoun\u001b[8G 5 is running in the background\u001b[40G(task\u001b[46G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbyepr2oin\u001b[57G\u001b[39mlane B). I'm checking\u001b[79Gthat Cod\u001b[88Gx s\u001b[92Garted properly and didn't\u001b[118Ghit\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bits usage\u001b[13Glimit\u001b[19Gagain.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file, listed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m directory \r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m Codex is reading the code, so the round is under way. Earlier rounds took about 15 minutes; I'll wait for it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;235;159;127mRecombobulating…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m\u001b[24G43s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.3k toke\u001b[42Gs)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Run /install-slack-app to use Claude in Slack\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
