1b[22m   berth; only the shape sweep stops it short of one.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 415 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- Under a cover with the least headroom its class allows, a vehicle flown in lands touching nothing   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 416 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  from some starts, not all: from others it touches the deck beside its berth or the cover's          \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 417 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  underside, or holds until its reservation lapses ([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ61\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m](roadmap.md#j61)).                           \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m418\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B 419 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m##\u001b[15GDecisions\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
