[0.066, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mI've stopped the low-approach tests; the gate now only re-runs the existing suites, and once it finishes I'll rewrite\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BJ61 to drop the prescribed suite matrix and leave the cause and fix to your GUI testing.\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · summary\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning cd\u001b[14G'/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-b'\u001b[52G&&\u001b[55G./scr…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/jettison.lane-b' && ./scripts/ci.sh --werror --asan --log build/gate.log 2>&1 | tail -30 \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B(1m 22s)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;233;154;122mFlowing…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(4m 36s · ↓\u001b[24G15.1k tokens)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Use /permissions to pre-approve and pre-deny bash, edit, and MCP tools\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔▔\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1m/btw \u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mis there a graphical client for the game to test right now, and how do i start it at the command line?\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G  Not f\u001b[11Gr this scenario, as far as I\u001b[40Gcan\u001b[44Gtell\u001b[49Gfrom this session:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mManifest\u001b[16G\u001b[22mhas\u001b[20Gno\u001b[23Ggraphical\u001b[33Gclient\u001b[40Gyet.\u001b[45GIts\u001b[49Gserver,\u001b[57Gconsole\u001b[65Gand\u001b[69Gtests\u001b[75Gstart\u001b[81Gthrough\u001b[89Ga\u001b[91Gsession.\u001b[100GIts\u001b[104Ggraphical\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G    client\u001b[14Gis its task L15, and tha\u001b[39G waits on the engine's\u001b[62GJ30,\u001b[67Gwhich\u001b[73Gisn't\u001b[79Gdone.\r\u001b[1B    - \u001b[1mThe engine's own windowed programs\u001b[22m are the ground sample and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrender_test\u001b[39m. Their binaries are in lane B's last\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B build:\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B-\u001b[9G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/clang-debug/source/samples/ground/ground\u001b[39m:\u001b[57Ga\u001b[59Grover\u001b[65Gon\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gground\u001b[79Gwith\u001b[84Ga\u001b[86Gchase\u001b[92Gcamera.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G    - \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/clang-debug/source/test/render_test [--scene ...]\u001b[39m:\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gshell\u001b[76Gwith\u001b[81Gno\u001b[84Ggame,\u001b[90Gover\u001b[95Gthe\u001b[99Gtest\u001b[104Gcontent's\r\u001b[1B        static scenes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B    Neither has docks or a covered berth in it, as far as I know.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mThe low-roof approach\u001b[29G\u001b[22mexists\u001b[36Gonly\u001b[41Gas\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gcase\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdock\u001b[63G\u001b[39mtest\u001b[68Gsuite\u001b[74G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/engine/dock/tests/ApproachTests.cpp\u001b[39m).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7GIt has \u001b[15Go scene\u001b[23Gand\u001b[27Gno\u001b[30Gcamera.\u001b[38GSeeing\u001b[45Git\u001b[48Gin\u001b[51Gthe\u001b[55GGUI\u001b[59Gwould\u001b[65Gtake\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gscene\u001b[78Gor\u001b[81Ga\u001b[83Gsmall\u001b[89Gprogram\u001b[97Gthat\u001b[102Gbuilds\u001b[109Gthat\u001b[120G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m↓\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[3m↑/↓\u001b[10Gscroll · c to copy · f to fork · Esc to close\u001b[23m\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H"]
