[0.058, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[4C\u001b[12B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mThe engine's own windowed programs\u001b[22m are\u001b[46Gthe grou\u001b[55Gd sample and \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mrender_test\u001b[39m. Their\u001b[87Gbinaries\u001b[96Gare\u001b[100Gin\u001b[103Glane\u001b[108GB's\u001b[112Glast\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7Gbuild:\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B- \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/clang-debug/source/samples/ground/ground\u001b[39m:\u001b[57Ga\u001b[59Grover\u001b[65Gon\u001b[68Gthe\u001b[72Gground\u001b[79Gwith\u001b[84Ga\u001b[86Gchase\u001b[92Gcamera.\r\u001b[33C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mtest/render_test [--scene ...]\u001b[39m: the shell with no\u001b[84Ggame, over the test\u001b[104Gcontent's\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B \u001b[9Gstatic scenes.\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1BNeither\u001b[15Ghas\u001b[19Gdocks\u001b[25Gor\u001b[28Ga\u001b[30Gcovered\u001b[38Gberth\u001b[44Gin\u001b[47Git,\u001b[51Gas\u001b[54Gfar\u001b[58Gas\u001b[61GI\u001b[63Gknow.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7G\u001b[1mThe low-roof approach\u001b[22m exists only as\u001b[44Ga case\u001b[51Gin\u001b[54Gthe\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdock\u001b[63G\u001b[39mtest suite\u001b[74G(\u001b[38;2;177;185;249msource/engine/dock/tests/ApproachTests.cpp\u001b[39m).\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7GIt has no scene and no camera. Seeing it in\u001b[51Gthe GUI would take a scene or a small program that builds that\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Blayout\u001b[14Gand fli\u001b[22Gs the long, low\u001b[38Gv\u001b[40Gh\u001b[42Gcle in.\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1BI\u001b[7Ghaven't\u001b[15Gchecked\u001b[23GManifest's\u001b[34Gcheckout\u001b[43Gor\u001b[46Gthe\u001b[50Gtest\u001b[55Gcontent's\u001b[65Gscenes\u001b[72Gfor\u001b[76Ganything\u001b[85Gwith\u001b[90Ga\u001b[92Gcovered\u001b[100Gberth.\u001b[107GAsk\u001b[111Gin\u001b[114Gthe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bmain conversation\u001b[23Gand it can\u001b[34Glook, or\u001b[43Gset up\u001b[50Ga viewabl\u001b[60G repro.    