ut the J02–J09 cross-review, and all four round-5 findings are now answered, gated green and \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bmerged into feature-base (not pushed). Next is J30, or first fixing the low-roof approach (J61) in the GUI as you \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[39m \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[3mplanned. (turn off recaps in /config)\r\u001b[2B\u001b[23m\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m/clear\u001b[39m                                                                                                                \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[3GMustering… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[32C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
