u001b[68Gfive\u001b[73Gchoices\u001b[81Gin\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Gships\u001b[94Gplan,\u001b[100Gread-only\u001b[110Gagainst\u001b[118Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gdata, and build once the size-class\u001b[39Gchange\u001b[46Gis\u001b[49Gmerged\u001b[56Ginto\u001b[61G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[39m.\u001b[75GSonnet\u001b[82Gwould\u001b[88Gbe\u001b[91Gfine\u001b[96Gfor\u001b[100Gdrafting,\u001b[110Gbut\u001b[114GOpus\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bat\u001b[6Ghigh\u001b[11Geffort\u001b[18Gis\u001b[21Gthe\u001b[25Gsafer\u001b[31Gchoice:\u001b[39Gthese\u001b[45Gchoices\u001b[53Gfix\u001b[57Gsave\u001b[62Gformats\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gdrive\u001b[80Gbalance\u001b[88Gfor\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Grest\u001b[101Gof\u001b[104Gthe\u001b[108Gstage.\u001b[115GPer\r\u001b[1B  your planning rule, the plan's cross-review would run on Sol 6.1 high.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GIf you'd rather bu\u001b[22Gld something with no c\u001b[46Gsh, the next independent\u001b[71Grow\u001b[75Gis\u001b[78GL01\u001b[82G(deployment\u001b[94Ghardening),\u001b[106Gbut\u001b[110Git\u001b[113Galso\r\u001b[1B  needs its own choices settled first (the operating platform, the security and the release limits).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BStart W22b's planning in lane C, or take\u001b[44GL01?\u001b[49GThe\u001b[53Gsize-class\u001b[64Gbuild\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74Gtests\u001b[80Gare\u001b[84Gstill\u001b[90Grunning\u001b[98Gin\u001b[101Gthe\u001b[105Gbackground.\r\u001b[67C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m993\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
