cargo\u001b[73Ghold\u001b[78GI\u001b[80Gguessed:\u001b[89G0.5%\u001b[94Gto\u001b[97G5%\u001b[100Gof\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107Ghull's\u001b[114Gvolume\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor\u001b[9Gwarships,\u001b[19G2%\u001b[22Gto\u001b[25G25%\u001b[29Gfor\u001b[33Gmerchant\u001b[42Gships.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G- The compact single-seat\u001b[29Gnow\u001b[33Gdocks\u001b[39Gas\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Gshuttle.\u001b[53GThe\u001b[57Glargest\u001b[65Ghold\u001b[70Gallowed\u001b[78Gis\u001b[81Gnow\u001b[85Gthe\u001b[89Gtitan's\u001b[97Gsize.\r\u001b[1B  - Five pinned world hashes changed because every station now posts fees for six more classes. With those\u001b[108Gfees\u001b[113Gleft\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bout, all five matched their old values.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mManifest, lane B, \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m70bc6e3\u001b[39m (the filter)\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GEach\u001b[10Ggame\u001b[15Gmode\u001b[20Gnow\u001b[24Glists\u001b[30Gwhich\u001b[36Ghulls\u001b[42Gand\u001b[46Gdrives\u001b[53Ga\u001b[55Gplayer\u001b[62Gis\u001b[65Gshown,\u001b[72Gthe\u001b[76Gsame\u001b[81Gway\u001b[85Git\u001b[88Galready\u001b[96Glists\u001b[102Ggoods\u001b[108Gand\u001b[112Gskills.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G-\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
