[0.079, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Gd\u001b[12Goverride: 10 credi\u001b[31Gs a tonne for each zone, \u001b[57Gnd\u001b[60G20 health\u001b[70Gand\u001b[74G40\u001b[77Ghappiness\u001b[87Glost.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Be\u001b[12Glicence fe\u001b[23G: 50,\u001b[29G0\u001b[31G.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bf\u001b[8GW\u001b[11Gre the \u001b[19Gry\u001b[22Gdock sits:\u001b[33Ginside the pl\u001b[47Gnet's 100,000 km zone.\u001b[70G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5GBefor\u001b[12Gits cross-review (Sol\u001b[34G6.1\u001b[38Ghigh),\u001b[45Glane\u001b[50GC\u001b[52Gneeds\u001b[58Glane\u001b[63GB's\u001b[67Gwork\u001b[72Gmerged\u001b[79Gin,\u001b[83Gan\u001b[86Gupdate\u001b[93Gfor\u001b[97Gthe\u001b[101Gnew\u001b[105Gfilter\u001b[112G(a\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bgrant\u001b[11Gd hull\u001b[18Gmust be in \u001b[30Ghe\u001b[33Gmode's\u001b[40Glist), and the stale\u001b[61Glines in\u001b[70G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mships-plan.md\u001b[39m:\u001b[85G\"three\u001b[92Ghulls\"\u001b[99Gand\u001b[103Gthe\u001b[107Gold\u001b[111Gseven\u001b[117Gpad\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gclass\u001b[11Gs.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mNext:\u001b[22m run the\u001b[17Ggates,\u001b[24GManifest\u001b[33Glane\u001b[38GB\u001b[40Gand\u001b[44Gthen\u001b[49GJettison\u001b[58Glane\u001b[63GC,\u001b[66Gone\u001b[70Gat\u001b[73Ga\u001b[75Gtime.\u001b[81GThen\u001b[86Gfast-forward\u001b[99Gboth\u001b[104Ginto\u001b[109G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39mand\u001b[7Ganswer\u001b[14Gthe\u001b[18GW22b\u001b[23Gquestions.\u001b[34GThis\u001b[39Gis\u001b[42Ga\u001b[44Ggood\u001b[49Gpoint\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/compact\u001b[67G\u001b[39mbefore\u001b[74Gstarting\u001b[83GW22b.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI haven't checked that a 1 km titan\u001b[39Gor\u001b[43Grk can actually fly in and dock; no\u001b[79Ghing uses\u001b[89Gthem\u001b[94Gyet.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 15m 6s · done 6:29 am\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mRemove the gunboat. It seems to overlap the corvette and jettison doesn't need overlaps. Then perform the next steps \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255myou mentioned. Titan and ark won't dock with other ships, they will fly to a coordinate, park, and then the drydock \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwill dock with them.\u001b[39m                                                                                                 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
