verlaps. Then perform the next steps \u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255myou m\u001b[9Gn\u001b[11Gioned. Ti\u001b[21Gan and ark\u001b[32Gw\u001b[34Gn't dock\u001b[43Gwith \u001b[49Gth\u001b[52Gr ships, they will fly \u001b[76Go a co\u001b[83Grdin\u001b[88Gte,\u001b[92Gpark, and then the drydock \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mwill dock with\u001b[18Gthem.\u001b[39m                                                                                                \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRemoving\u001b[12Gthe\u001b[16Ggunboat\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Grecording\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gtitan\u001b[48Gand\u001b[52Gark\u001b[56Gdocking\u001b[64Grule\u001b[69Gfirst.\u001b[76GThen\u001b[81Gthe\u001b[85Ggates\u001b[91G(Manifest,\u001b[102Gthen\u001b[107GJettison),\u001b[118Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gfast-forwards, and \u001b[23Ghe W22b plan updates.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m·\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
