[0.171, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5G \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m and cartridg\u001b[25Gs come fr\u001b[35Gm the ship's own \u001b[53Gold, bought through the book. An exhausted \u001b[97Gupply\u001b[103Ghas\u001b[107Gno cons\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m equence\u001b[20Gyet.\u001b[25GSee\u001b[29G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mstations: resupply\u001b[39m](stations.md#resupply-refill-and-replace).\u001b[92G|\u001b[94GImplemented\u001b[106G(W06;\u001b[112G`c\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[12G\u001b[22mompany`,\u001b[21G`world`);\u001b[31Gexhaustion's\u001b[44Gconsequence\u001b[56Gopen\u001b[61Gas\u001b[64G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL45\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l45)\u001b[93G|\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m 209 \u001b[22m | <a\u001b[17G\u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-098\"\u001b[39m></a>D-098\u001b[38G|\u001b[40GOwners set \u001b[52Gheir ch\u001b[60Grges | Owners set the charge\u001b[89G on wh\u001b[96Gt they hold:\u001b[109Gan op\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m erator its\u001b[23Gdocking and berth fees, a\u001b[49Gwarehouse owner its storage fee, a gate's\u001b[91Gowner\u001b[97Gits\u001b[101Gtoll,\u001b[107Ga\u001b[109Ggover\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[12G\u001b[22mnor\u001b[16Gits\u001b[20Gregion's\u001b[29Gtaxes.\u001b[36GA\u001b[38Gchange\u001b[45Gapplies\u001b[53Gto\u001b[56Glater\u001b[62Gcharges\u001b[70Gonly.\u001b[76GUnpaid\u001b[83Gcharges\u001b[91Gare\u001b[95Garrears\u001b[103Gat\u001b[106Gthe\u001b[110Gcred\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m itor's ra\u001b[22Ge, up\u001b[28Gto the usury limit (`charges.maxArrearsRateBps`). | Implem\u001b[87Gnted for station\u001b[104Gfees\u001b[109G(W18;\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[13G\u001b[22m`company`,\u001b[24G`travel`);\u001b[35Gstorage\u001b[43Gfees,\u001b[49Gtolls\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59Gtaxes\u001b[65Gopen\u001b[70Gas\u001b[73G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL16\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l16),\u001b[103G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL10\u001b[39m](deliv\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m ery-order.md#l10) and [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL29\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l29)\u001b[63G|\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 210 \u001b[12G\u001b[22m|\u001b[14G<a\u001b[17G\u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-100\"\u001b[39m></a>D-100\u001b[38G|\u001b[40GFees\u001b[45Gby\u001b[48Gfee\u001b[52Gclass\u001b[58G|\u001b[60GA\u001b[62Gship\u001b[67Gpays\u001b[72Gby\u001b[75Gits\u001b[79G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mfee class\u001b[39m](glossary.md#fee-class):\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m  a docking fee as its journey starts and a berth fee each hour docked, plus a share for each connected\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m  occupant (`charges`). An AI operator moves its fees with occupancy once a day. [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mArrears\u001b[39m](glossary.md#\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m arrears) hold the ship and, after a grace, its cargo is sold. See [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mstations: fees by fee class\u001b[39m](statio\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[12G\u001b[22mns.md#fees-by-fee-class).\u001b[38G|\u001b[40GImplemented\u001b[52G(W18;\u001b[58G`company`,\u001b[69G`travel`,\u001b[79G`policy`,\u001b[89G`fixture_traffic`)\u001b[108G|\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-b' && rg -n -i gunboat . -g '!build' ; head -4 \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mdata/docks/hulls/hull-titan.yaml data/docks/hulls/hull-ark.yaml; rg -c \"hullId:\" data/ships/hulls.yaml; rg -n \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\"share of th\u001b[19G hull\" -A2 dat\u001b[34G/ships/hulls.yaml\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;230;149;117mReticulating…\u001b[18G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m35s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.5k \u001b[32Gokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[18C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
