[0.061, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[12Gnor its region's taxes. A change applies to later ch\u001b[66Gges only. Unpaid charges are arrears at the cred\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bitor's rate, up to the\u001b[35Gusu\u001b[39Gy limit (`charges.maxArrearsRateBps`). | Impl\u001b[85Gmente\u001b[91G for station fees (W18;\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B `company`, `travel`); storag\u001b[42G fe\u001b[46Gs, tolls and taxes\u001b[65Gopen\u001b[70Gas\u001b[73G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL16\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l16),\u001b[103G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL10\u001b[39m](deliv\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22mery-order.md#l10) \u001b[31Gnd [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL29\u001b[39m](d\u001b[42Glivery-order.md#l29) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m210\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-100\"\u001b[39m></a>D-100 | Fees by fee class | A ship pays by\u001b[75Gits [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mfee class\u001b[39m](glossary.md#fee-class):\r\u001b[12C\u001b[1Ba docking fee as its journey star\u001b[47Gs and a berth f\u001b[63Ge\u001b[65Geac\u001b[70Ghour do\u001b[78Gked, plus \u001b[89G share for each connected\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B occupant (`charge\u001b[31G`).\u001b[35GA\u001b[37G AI op\u001b[45Gator moves its fees\u001b[65Gwith occupancy once a day. [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mArrears\u001b[39m](glossary.md#\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Barrears) hold th\u001b[29G ship and,\u001b[40Gafter a grace, its \u001b[60Gargo is sold. See [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mstations: fees by fee class\u001b[39m](statio\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[12G\u001b[22mns.md#fees-by-fee-class).\u001b[38G|\u001b[40GImplemented\u001b[52G(W18;\u001b[58G`company`,\u001b[69G`travel`,\u001b[79G`policy`,\u001b[89G`fixture_traffic`)\u001b[108G|\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe titan and ark comments s\u001