[0.024, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[7G\u001b[2m209\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-098\"\u001b[39m></\u001b[31G>D-098\u001b[38G| Own\u001b[44Grs set their cha\u001b[61Gges | Owners set the charges on wh\u001b[96Gt they\u001b[103Ghold: an op\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Berator\u001b[19Gits docking\u001b[31Gand\u001b[35Gberth\u001b[41Gfees,\u001b[47Ga warehouse owner its storage fee, a gate's owner its toll, a\u001b[109Ggover\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bnor its region's taxes. A change applies to later charg\u001b[68Gs\u001b[70Gonly. Unpaid charges a\u001b[93Ge arrears\u001b[103Gat the cred\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bitor's rate, up to the usury limit (`charges.maxArrearsRateBps`).\u001b[78G|\u001b[80GImplemented\u001b[92Gfor\u001b[96Gstation\u001b[104Gfees\u001b[109G(W18;\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m   \u001b[12G\u001b[22m `company`, `travel`); storag\u001b[42G fees, tolls and taxes open as [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL16\u001b[39m](delivery-order.md#l16), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL10\u001b[39m](deliv\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1Bery-\u001b[17Grder.md#l10)\u001b[30Gand\u001b[34G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mL29\u001b[39m](delivery-or\u001b[52Ger.md#l29) |\u001b[65G\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m210\u001b[12G\u001b[22m| <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"d-100\"\u001b[39m></a>D-100\u001b[38G| Fees by fee class |\u001b[60GA ship pays by its [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mfee class\u001b[39m](glossary.md#fee-class):\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B a docking fee as\u001b[30Gits journey starts and a\u001b[55Gberth fee\u001b[65Geach hour docked, plus a share for each connec\u001b[112Ged\r\u001b[11C\u001b[1B occupant (`charges`). An\u001b[38GAI o\u001b[43Gerator moves its fees with occupancy once a day. [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mArrears\u001b[39m](glossary.md#\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m     \u001b[12G\u001b[22marrears)\u001b[21Ghold\u001b[26Gthe\u001b[30Gship\u001b[35Gand,\u001b[40Gafter\u001b[46Ga\u001b[48Ggrace,\u001b[55Gits\u001b[59Gcargo\u001b[65Gis\u001b[68Gsold.\u001b[74GSee\u001b[78G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mstations: fees by fee class\u001b[39m](statio\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m     \u001b[22m ns.md#fees-by-fee-class).\u001b[38G|\u001b[40GImplemented\u001b[52G(W18;\u001b[58G`company`,\u001b[69G`travel`,\u001b[79G`policy`,\u001b[89G`fixture_traffic`)\u001b[108G|\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThe\u001b[7Gtitan\u001b[13Gand\u001b[17Gark\u001b[21Gcomments\u001b[30Gstill\u001b[36Gsay\u001b[40G\"on\u001b[44Ga\u001b[46Gtitan\u001b[52Gpad\",\u001b[58Gwhich\u001b[64Gnow\u001b[68Gcontradicts\u001b[80Gthe\u001b[84Grule.\u001b[90GFixing\u001b[97Gthat,\u001b[103Grunning\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gaffected suites, then committing.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning \u001b[1m6\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd '/home/ivan/projec\u001b[30Gs/manifest.lane-b' && sed -n 146,156p docs/build-and-gates.md\r\u001b[41C\u001b[2Bthought for 1s)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
