[0.028, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[39m \u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manif\u001b[27Gst.lane-c/docs/ships-plan.md)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded\u001b[12G\u001b[1m3\u001b[14G\u001b[22mlines, removed \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m li\u001b[35Gs\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m0\u001b[14G\u001b[22ma company and `Journey`'s `over\u001b[46Gide` and `fine`, and the\u001b[71Gcruise's\u001b[80Gtwo cleara\u001b[91Gces replace \u001b[104Gts\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m1\u001b[14G\u001b[22mone. A load refuses a licence from no polity, \u001b[61G claim of no\u001b[74Ggrant\u001b[80Gof the\u001b[87Gscenario \u001b[97Gnd a fine\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 292 \u001b[22m   below 0. Formats change in place, with no migration, as for every format before player testing.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 293 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Jettison.** None needed: the layout's decks, piers, features and display vehicles,                \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 293 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m- **Jettison.** None needed\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m for W22b\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m: the layout's decks, piers, features and display vehicles,       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 294 \u001b[22m   `Dock::Fits`, `Park` and `RequestBerth` are at the pin, and the cruise is Manifest's. W22b3\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 295 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  proves a 280 m hull docks at a battleship pad; if it cannot, that is a Jettison item first.         \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m5\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mp\u001b[16Goves a\u001b[23G280 m hull docks at a\u001b[45Gba\u001b[48Gtleship pad; if it\u001b[67Gc\u001b[69Gnnot, \u001b[76Ghat is a Jettison item first.\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m A\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 296 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  dry dock docking with a parked titan-class ship is a later Jettison provision (above).              \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m7\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**Modu\u001b[21Ges.** `content` (the\u001b[42Gdrive, item, grant and venu\u001b[70G rules), `space` (the two\u001b[96Gclearances),\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m8\u001b[15G\u001b[22mtravel` (fuel by the uni\u001b[40G, the\u001b[46Gc\u001b[48Gearances, the override),\u001b[73G`company` (refu\u001b[89Glling, `Apply`,\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 299 \u001b[14G\u001b[22m`SetLicence`,\u001b[28G`Claim`),\u001b[38G`trade`\u001b[46G(licensed\u001b[56Ggoods),\u001b[64G`policy`\u001b[73G(estimates,\u001b[85Glicensed\u001b[94Ggoods),\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Running \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m shell commands…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ \u001b[9Gd '/home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-c'\u001b[49G&& awk 'FNR>=14 && FNR<=21 {print length\":\u001b[92G\"$0}' doc\u001b[102G/ships-plan.md; git\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bshow feature-base:docs/ships-plan.md | awk 'length > 100' | wc -l; awk 'length > 100' docs/ships-plan.md | wc -l\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
