[0.058, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m  3 \u001b[22mbroken rules, claims that do not hold, and designs that will cost the project later. You are not\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  4 \u001b[22mhere to agree. A review that finds nothing should say what you tried and why it held.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  5 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  6 \u001b[22mRead before judging:\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  7 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  8 \u001b[22m- `CLAUDE.md` (how the project works; it applies to you as much as to the author).\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m  9 \u001b[22m- `docs/coding-standards.md`. Manifest's model modules are deterministic: no wall clock, the\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m… +146 lines \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mWrite\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest.lane-c/build/reviews/w22b-plan/round-2.before)\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mWrote\u001b[12G\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line to \u001b[1m~/projects/manifest.lane-c/build/reviews/w22b-plan/round-2.before\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[2m1 \u001b[22me3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855\u001b[75G-\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2B\u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command…\u001b[K\r\u001b[100C\u001b[3B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;225;139;107mOrbiting…\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m16\u001b[17G 26s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m35.0k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[20C\u001b[6B\u001b[38;2;0;204;204m1\u001b[23Gshell\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrup\u001b[47G · ← 1 agent · ↓ to manage\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
