[0.078, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m 295 \u001b[22m   body's motion still to come before the arrival crossing begins. At each end that is the crossing's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 296 \u001b[22m   own place, so the frames join without a jump, and near each end the ship moves with that end's\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 297 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  body, which cannot catch it. Today's crossings are relative to the course's                         \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m 298 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  \u001b[48;2;92;2;0mcarrier, the star \u001b[48;2;61;1;0mbetween planets, which leaves a planet's ship behind as it orbits on (about       \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m9\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;92;2;0m250,000 km in the 2.3 \u001b[48;2;61;1;0mhours); the hauler'\u001b[56G 1,000 km crossing and its course\u001b[90Gmove\u001b[95Gto\u001b[98Gthese\u001b[104Gframes\u001b[111Gtoo\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m   \u001b[12G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m,\u001b[14Gand                      \u001b[40G        \u001b[49G     \u001b[55G      \u001b[62G \u001b[64G        \u001b[73G    \u001b[78G      \u001b[85G  \u001b[88G  \u001b[91G      \u001b[98G  \u001b[101G      \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m300\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m\u001b[48;2;92;2;0mthe W22a \u001b[48;2;61;1;0mfixtures' pins move with\u001b[48Git.     \u001b[57G     \u001b[63G  \u001b[66G        \u001b[75G   \u001b[79G   \u001b[83G      \u001b[90G    \u001b[95G  \u001b[98G     \u001b[104G      \u001b[111G   \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 297 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  body, which cannot catch it. Today's crossings are relative to the course's\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m carrier, the star\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m       \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 298 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  between planets, which leaves a planet's ship behind as it orbits on (about\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m 250,000 km in the 2.3\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m   \r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m9\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mh\u001b[16Gurs); the\u001b[26Gh\u001b[28Guler's 1,000 km crossing and it\u001b[61Gcours\u001b[67G move to these fram\u001b[87Gs too, and\u001b[48;2;4;71;0m the W22\u001b[106G\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m \r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m300\u001b[14G\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfixtures' pins move with it. \u001b[44G \u001b[46G        \u001b[55G    \u001b[60G      \u001b[67G  \u001b[70G  \u001b[73G      \u001b[80G  \u001b[83G                            \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 301 \u001b[22m - **Two clearances.** `Space::CruiseDrive` and `Space::Cruising` split `clearance` into\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 302 \u001b[22m   `departureClearance` and `arrivalClearance`, which `travel` writes as it writes the flown\u001b[K\r\u001b[8C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m3\u001b[12G\u001b[22m \u001b[14Gprofile. The hauler's stay its 1,000 km.\u001b[55G`Policy::EstimateRoute` takes both.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mRunning the W22b plan cross-review, round\u001b[45G3\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ cd /home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-c && codex exec -C /home/ivan/projects/manifest.lane-c -s workspace-write -m\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mgpt-6.1-sol -c 'model_reasoning_effort=\"high\"' -o build/reviews/w22b-plan/round-3.md - < \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mbu\u001b[9Gld/reviews/w22b-plan/round-3.prompt > build\u001b[53Greviews/w22b-plan/round-3.log 2>&1; echo \"exit …\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
