[0.203, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 153 \u001b[12G\u001b[22mfreighter's\u001b[24G100\u001b[28Gkg\u001b[31Gmagazine,\u001b[41Geight\u001b[47Gtotes\u001b[53Gof\u001b[56Gdeuterium,\u001b[67Ggets\u001b[72G12.5\u001b[77Gkg\u001b[80Ga\u001b[82Grefuel.\u001b[90GInstead\u001b[98Git\u001b[101Gbuys\u001b[106Gthe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 154 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtotes the magazine's room needs, less the whole totes aboard, then fills the magazine as it does      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 155 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mtoday. The starter's 12.5 kg magazine still takes one tote.                                           \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 154 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mwhole totes the magazine's room takes, straight from the warehouse into the magazine as reaction mass \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 155 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mgoes into the tanks, so a hold the policy has filled does not stop it; pellets carried as cargo stay  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 156 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mcargo. The starter's 12.5 kg magazine still takes one tote, no longer through its hold, so the        \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 157 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242mfixtures' pins move.                                                                                  \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m 158 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 159 \u001b[22m **Units and kilograms.** A magazine, a burn and a job's fuel stay in kilograms (`World::Fuel`,\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 160 \u001b[22m `Job::pelletKilograms`); a fuel item's traded unit is converted at its kilograms a unit, from its\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest.lane-c/docs/ships-plan.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[