[0.089, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mF3, the moving-planet problem.\u001b[36G\u001b[22mOre\u001b[40Gmoves\u001b[46Gabout\u001b[52G250,000\u001b[60Gkm\u001b[63Gduring\u001b[70Ga\u001b[72Gship's\u001b[79G2.3-hour\u001b[88Gcrossing,\u001b[98Gso\u001b[101Ga\u001b[103Gship\u001b[108Gthat\u001b[113Gdoesn't\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  move with the planet gets caught by it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G- My round-2 fix made the ship\u001b[36Gmove with\u001b[46Gthe planets near\u001b[63Geach end\u001b[72Gof the\u001b[79Gtrip. The \u001b[90Geviewer\u001b[99Ghowed \u001b[106Gt\u001b[108Gisn't enough:\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B  a sh\u001b[12Gp leaving at a 0.2% thrust share\u001b[45Gdrifts\u001b[52Gback\u001b[57Ginto\u001b[62Ga\u001b[64Gstation's\u001b[74Gzone\u001b[79Gwhile\u001b[85Gstill\u001b[91Gthrusting,\u001b[102Gabout\u001b[108G4\u001b[110Ghours\u001b[116Gin.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B \u001b[7GTheir scripts are in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mbuild/reviews/w22b-plan/scratch/\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B-\u001b[7GThe fix now in\u001b[22Gthe plan check\u001b[37G each trip before it s\u001b[60Garts instead of trust\u001b[82Gng\u001b[85Gthe geometry. If\u001b[102Gthe drive would\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bfire inside a\u001b[21Gzone, travel lengthens that end's crossing\u001b[64Gand\u001b[68Gplans\u001b[74Gagain,\u001b[81Gup\u001b[84Gto\u001b[87G4\u001b[89Gtimes,\u001b[96Gthen\u001b[101Grefuses\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gtrip.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mF9.\u001b[22m Pulse\u001b[15Gunits for the magazine\u001b[38Gnow go straight from \u001b[60Ghe warehouse\u001b[73Ginto it, so\u001b[85Ga full hold can't block a ref\u001b[115Gel.\u001b[119GA\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bside \u001b[11Gffect is that the starter hull'\u001b[44Grefuel changes too,\u001b[64Gso some pinned test\u001b[84Ghashes will\u001b[96Gmove.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mDecision for you:\u001b[22m should I run a fo\u001b[39Grth review round on\u001b[60Ghe F3