[0.105, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[2m    \u001b[11G\u001b[22mup\u001b[14Ga\u001b[16Gclearance;\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Ga\u001b[33Glicence\u001b[41Gor\u001b[44Gstanding\u001b[53Gchecked\u001b[61Gwith\u001b[66Gthe\u001b[70Gclearance,\u001b[81Gonce\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Ggame\u001b[95Ghas\u001b[99Gfactions.\u001b[109G**Don\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m e when** each is tested in the `space` suite. | Settle the licence and standing rules, once the game ha\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m s factions. | [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mSpace plan\u001b[39m](space-plan.md)\u001b[53G|\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 89 \u001b[22m | 37 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"l39\"\u001b[39m></a>L39 | Policy scripts in Wasm: a script ranks a standing policy's trade candidate\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[22m s by bounded facts\u001b[30Gthrough\u001b[38Gone\u001b[42Ginput,\u001b[49G`manifest.trade.score`;\u001b[73Gnative\u001b[80Gcode\u001b[85Genumerates\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gcandidates,\u001b[112Gva\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m lidates the choice and settles it. Scripts gain no\u001b[62Gbalances,\u001b[72Gregistries\u001b[83Gor\u001b[86Gsettlement\u001b[97G([\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-004\u001b[39m](decision\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m -ledger.md#d-004)). **Done when** a script's score picks a trade,\u001b[77Ga\u001b[79Gtrap\u001b[84Gor\u001b[87Ga\u001b[89Gbad\u001b[93Gscore\u001b[99Gfalls\u001b[105Gback\u001b[110Gto\u001b[113Gz\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ero, ties are deterministic, and a policy with no script runs natively.\u001b[83G|\u001b[85GSettle\u001b[92Gthe\u001b[96Gfact\u001b[101Gnames\u001b[107Gand\u001b[111Gthe\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m ir normalisation. A script that reads the world waits on Jettison's [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mJ04\u001b[39m](../../jettison/docs/roadmap.m\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[11G\u001b[22md#j04).\u001b[19G|\u001b[21G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mPolicy scripts plan\u001b[39m](policy-scripts-plan.md)\u001b[67G|\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m 90 \u001b[22m | 38 | <a \u001b[38;2;166;226;46mid\u001b[39m=\u001b[38;2;230;219;116m\"l40\"\u001b[39m></a>L40 | Saves off the step's thread: no flush, snapshot or backup holds a step or\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B     \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m a frame. The files are written durably beside the loop, the catalogue published only once what it names\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[12G\u001b[22mis\u001b[15Gon\u001b[18Gdisk,\u001b[24Gand\u001b[28Gthe\u001b[32Gserialising\u001b[44Gbrought\u001b[52Gunder\u001b[58Ga\u001b[60Gstep's\u001b[67Gbudget\u001b[74Gas\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gworld\u001b[87Ggrows.\u001b[94G**Done\u001b[101Gwhen**\u001b[108Ga\u001b[110Gflus\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m h and a snapshot no longer stall the server's\u001b[57Gloop,\u001b[63Gand\u001b[67Grecovery\u001b[76Gholds\u001b[82Gas\u001b[85Git\u001b[88Gdoes\u001b[93Gtoday.\u001b[100G|\u001b[102GTaken\u001b[108Gup\u001b[111Gbef\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m    \u001b[11G\u001b[22more\u001b[15Ga\u001b[17Gworld\u001b[23Goutgrows\u001b[32Ga\u001b[34Gstep,\u001b[40Gor\u001b[43Ga\u001b[45Gframe\u001b[51Gis\u001b[54Gdrawn\u001b[60Gbeside\u001b[67Gone.\u001b[72GA\u001b[74Greusable\u001b[83Gwriter\u001b[90Gis\u001b[93GJettison's.\u001b[105G|\u001b[107G[\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mPersis\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[3G   \u001b[2m    \u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;230;219;116mtence\u001b[39m](persistence.md), [\u001b[38;2;230;219;116mD-115\u001b[39m](decision-le\u001b[55Gger.md#d-115) |\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading\u001b[11G\u001b[1m1\u001b[13G\u001b[22mfile,\u001b[19Grunning\u001b[27G\u001b[1m2\u001b[29G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[35Gcommands…\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m ⎿  ~/projects/manifest.lane-c/docs/ships-plan.md\r\u001b[18C\u001b[8B(shift+tab to cycle) · esc to inte\u001b[54Grupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u