[0.434, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G   \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 329 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  continues it without checking again. The minutes spent clearing move the bodies little, but the     \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;80;200;80m\u001b[48;2;2;40;0m 330 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  course may still differ: where Start's settled driven metres exceed those paid for, the extra is    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 331 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  burnt from the fuel aboard, and where that is short of the extra plus the fuel margin the cruise    \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;80;200;80m 332 +\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m  is refused (`Failure::CruiseRefused`, as today when a cruise cannot start).                         \r\u001b[7C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m33\u001b[12G\u001b[22m-\u001b[14G**Two\u001b[20Gclearances.**\u001b[34G`Space::CruiseDrive`\u001b[55Gand\u001b[59G`Space::Cruising`\u001b[77Gsplit\u001b[83G`clearance`\u001b[95Ginto\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 334 \u001b[22m   `departureClearance` and `arrivalClearance`, which `travel` writes as it writes the flown\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 335 \u001b[22m   profile. The hauler's stay its 1,000 km. `Policy::EstimateRoute` takes both.\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRead \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;78;186;101m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdate\u001b[22m(~/projects/manifest.lane-c/docs/ships-plan.md)\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  \u001b[39mAdded \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line, removed \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m line\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 387 \u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 388 \u001b[22m | Step | What | Done when |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m 389 \u001b[22m | --- | --- | --- |\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;220;90;90m\u001b[48;2;61;1;0m 390 -\u001b[38;2;248;248;242m| W22b