[0.061, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[5Glooks each minute while the drive thrusts and each hour while the ship coasts. A planet, moon or the star in the\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bway is added to the obstacles and the course is planned again, up to four times, then the journey is refused.\u001b[115GThe\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bpolicy's route estimate uses the same check. Option C, a Jettison motion profile where the ship leaves with its\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bplanet's velocity and arrives with the target's, is recorded under L37 in \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdelivery-order.md\u001b[39m as the later replacement\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bfor the blend.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRound 5 raised two findings, both confirmed fixed by round 6:\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mF9:\u001b[22m afte\u001b[16G a partial\u001b[27Gsale, the unsold cargo i\u001b[52G loade\u001b[59G back and leaves too\u001b[80Glittle hold room to refuel.\u001b[108GThe\u001b[112Gestimate\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bnow\u001b[11Gcounts\u001b[18Gonly\u001b[23Gthe\u001b[27Gfuel\u001b[32Gthe\u001b[36Ghold\u001b[41Gcan\u001b[45Gtake.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  - \u001b[1mF10's hand-off:\u001b[22m the\u001b[27Gcheck\u001b[33Gran\u001b[37Gbefore\u001b[44Gundocking,\u001b[55Gbut\u001b[59Gthe\u001b[63Gcourse\u001b[70Gis\u001b[73Gplanned\u001b[81Gafter\u001b[87Gclearing\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gstation.\u001b[109GThe\u001b[113Gcheck\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1Bnow\u001b[11Galso\u001b[16Gruns\u001b[21Gat\u001b[24Gthat\u001b[29Gpoint,\u001b[36Gand\u001b[40Gthe\u001b[44Gcourse\u001b[51Git\u001b[54Gsettles\u001b[62Gis\u001b[65Gthe\u001b[69Gone\u001b[73Gflown\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gsaved.\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3G  - Round 6 also confirmed that \u001b[38G earl\u001b[44Ger F11\u001b[51Gand F12 fixes hold.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mRound 6 raised F13:\u001b[25G\u001b[22mthe\u001b[29Gsecond\u001b[36Gcheck\u001b[42Ghad\u001b[46Gnothing\u001b[54Gsaved\u001b[60Gto\u001b[63Gcompare\u001b[71Gits\u001b[75Gfuel\u001b[80Gagainst.\u001b[89GThe\u001b[93Gjourney\u001b[101Gnow\u001b[105Gsaves\u001b[111Gthe\u001b[115Gfuel\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  burnt at departure,\u001b[25Gand\u001b[29Gthe\u001b[33Gcruise\u001b[40Gsettles\u001b[48Gthe\u001b[52Gdifference\u001b[63Gboth\u001b[68Gways:\u001b[74Ga\u001b[76Glonger\u001b[83Gcourse\u001b[90Gburns\u001b[96Gthe\u001b[100Gextra\u001b[106Gor\u001b[109Gis\u001b[112Grefused,\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Ba\u001b[7Gshorter\u001b[15Gone\u001b[19Gis\u001b[22Grefunded.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BEverything\u001b[14Gup\u001b[17Gto\u001b[20GF13\u001b[24Ghas\u001b[28Gbeen\u001b[33Greviewed.\u001b[43GThe\u001b[47GF13\u001b[51Gfix\u001b[55Gis\u001b[58Gthe\u001b[62Gonly\u001b[67Gtext\u001b[72Gno\u001b[75Ground\u001b[81Ghas\u001b[85Gchecked.\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GThe push also carried thr\u001b[29Ge \u001b[32Garlier commits that were merged but not\u001b[72Gyet\u001b[76Gpushed:\u001b[84Gthe\u001b[88Geleven\u001b[95Gpad\u001b[99Gclasses,\u001b[108Gthe\u001b[112Ggame-mode\r\u001b[1B  hull filter, and the gunboat removal.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3GJettison's \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfeature-base\u001b[27G\u001b[39mhas two commits that aren't pushed:\u001b[63G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m63ddab0\u001b[71G\u001b[39m(dock\u001b[77Gfixture\u001b[85Gnames)\u001b[92Gand\u001b[96G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m8e74110\u001b[104G\u001b[39m(J02–J09\u001b[113Ground\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
